          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Jellyfin sends: its IP address and its program name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu’envoie Jellyfin : son adresse IP et son nom de programme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Safari sends that site (your IP address, its cookies). Mira sends it nothing and loads nothing from it before your touch. A trailer kept on your server goes through it alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Safari envoie à ce site (ton adresse IP, ses cookies). Mira ne lui envoie rien et n’en charge rien avant ton toucher. Une bande-annonce gardée sur ton serveur ne passe que par lui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you watched this month and this year.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu as regardé ce mois-ci et cette année."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Jellyfin looks for updates to its extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Jellyfin cherche les mises à jour de ses extensions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Jellyfin or the file’s chapters mark them, playback jumps over them. Otherwise, a button offers it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Jellyfin ou les chapitres du fichier les repèrent, la lecture saute par-dessus. Sinon, un bouton le propose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Jellyfin scans your library, and when you fix a title.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Jellyfin analyse ta bibliothèque, et quand tu corriges un titre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you install Mira and at its weekly refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand tu installes Mira, puis à son rafraîchissement de chaque semaine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you’re signed in: library, pictures, playback, Watch together, titles kept on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
