        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to Tailscale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relié à Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to %@’s home network…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connexion au réseau du foyer %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices in the home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appareils du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnecter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect Tailscale from the home?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnecter Tailscale du foyer ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnecter…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each device that typed the password. Removing one closes its profile; it will need the password to come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque appareil qui a tapé le mot de passe. En retirer un ferme son profil ; il lui faudra le mot de passe pour revenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ends %@. Send it with the password, by two different ways if you can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finit le %@. Envoie-le avec le mot de passe, par deux chemins différents si tu peux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device in the home will need to type the new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque appareil du foyer devra taper le nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device leaves the home and its profiles close. The Jellyfin accounts stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les appareils sortent du foyer et leurs profils se ferment. Les comptes Jellyfin restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First connect the home to your Tailscale network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relie d’abord le foyer à ton réseau Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First finish “Away from home” below: it’s once only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termine d’abord « Loin de chez toi » plus bas : une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a device away from home: the link takes Mira to your Jellyfin through Tailscale, with no address or Tailscale account to create. It works once and ends after 48 hours; the password is still asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour un appareil loin de chez toi : le lien emmène Mira jusqu’à ton Jellyfin par Tailscale, sans adresse ni compte Tailscale à créer. Il sert une seule fois et finit au bout de 48 heures ; le mot de passe reste demandé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forgot it? Ask %@’s administrator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oublié ? Demande à l’administrateur de %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found at this address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouvé à cette adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masquer le mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home link": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lien du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home link QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QR code du lien du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mot de passe du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have my own account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J’ai mon propre compte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its profile closes. It will need the password, and away from home a new link, to come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son profil se ferme. Il lui faudra le mot de passe, et loin de chez toi un nouveau lien, pour revenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join %@’s home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejoindre le foyer %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter ce foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this home?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter ce foyer ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaving the home…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortie du foyer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a home link": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Créer un lien du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira can’t reach this home from this iPhone right now. Close Mira and open it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira ne peut pas joindre ce foyer depuis cet iPhone pour l’instant. Ferme Mira et rouvre-le."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira knows where this home is, there and away from it. Nothing else to install or type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira sait où est ce foyer, chez lui comme ailleurs. Rien d’autre à installer ni à taper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira sur %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveau mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next: pick your profile. This iPhone stays in the home until it’s removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ensuite : choisis ton profil. Cet iPhone reste dans le foyer tant qu’on ne l’en retire pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No devices yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun appareil pour l’instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Internet connection right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas de connexion à Internet pour l’instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No more home links. Devices already away from home keep their access until you remove them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus aucun lien du foyer. Les appareils déjà loin de chez toi gardent leur accès tant que tu ne les retires pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No profile open": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun profil ouvert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No profiles in this home yet: ask its administrator to turn one on in Settings → Home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun profil dans ce foyer pour l’instant : demande à son administrateur d’en cocher un dans Réglages → Foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once only: Mira makes the home links’ keys on your Tailscale network itself. The home’s devices see only Jellyfin there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une seule fois : Mira crée lui-même les clés des liens du foyer sur ton réseau Tailscale. Les appareils du foyer n’y voient que Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One password for the family, then “Who’s watching?”: profiles, PINs, devices, the home link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un mot de passe pour la famille, puis « Qui regarde ? » : profils, codes, appareils, lien du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One password for the whole family: on a device, it opens “Who’s watching?” with the profiles you pick below. No administrator is ever one of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un seul mot de passe pour toute la famille : sur un appareil, il ouvre « Qui regarde ? » avec les profils que tu choisis ci-dessous. Aucun administrateur n’en fait partie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Tailscale’s credentials": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les identifiants de Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opened from %@’s link": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvert depuis le lien de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening %@’s profile…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouverture du profil de %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "or hold the Settings tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ou appui long sur l’onglet Réglages"
          }
