    },
    "Secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secret"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send the home link": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envoyer le lien du foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher le mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signing in…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connexion…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changer de profil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale didn’t answer. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale n’a pas répondu. Réessaie dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale isn’t on on Jellyfin’s PC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale n’est pas allumé sur le PC de Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale refuses the home’s OAuth client: it was deleted or revoked. Connect the home again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale refuse le client OAuth du foyer : il a été supprimé ou révoqué. Relie de nouveau le foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s not the right PIN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas le bon code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s not the right PIN. %lld tries left.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "That’s not the right PIN. %lld try left."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "That’s not the right PIN. %lld tries left."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ce n’est pas le bon code. Encore %lld essai."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ce n’est pas le bon code. Encore %lld essais."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The home is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le foyer est désactivé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The home isn’t connected to your Tailscale network: it works only at home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le foyer n’est pas relié à ton réseau Tailscale : il ne marche qu’à la maison."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The home password is set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mot de passe du foyer est enregistré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Jellyfin accounts the home offers. A 4-digit PIN keeps a profile from the others; an administrator always has one. Can download opens Downloads (TorLink) without being an administrator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les comptes Jellyfin que le foyer propose. Un code à 4 chiffres garde un profil des autres ; un administrateur en a toujours un. « Peut télécharger » ouvre les téléchargements (TorLink) sans être administrateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server says nothing about Tailscale: update the Mira extension.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur ne dit rien de Tailscale : mets à jour l’extension Mira."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tag:mira-home tag isn’t in your Tailscale policy yet (tagOwners).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’étiquette tag:mira-home n’est pas encore dans ta politique Tailscale (tagOwners)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toute la bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This home link is incomplete: copy all of it, or ask for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien du foyer est incomplet : recopie-le en entier, ou demande-en un nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is no longer in %@’s home. To come back, ask for a new home link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet iPhone n’est plus dans le foyer %@. Pour revenir, demande un nouveau lien du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone left %@’s home here; the server didn’t hear it: its administrator can remove it in Settings → Home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet iPhone a quitté le foyer %@ ici ; le serveur ne l’a pas su : son administrateur peut le retirer dans Réglages → Foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone left %@’s home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet iPhone a quitté le foyer %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn’t %@’s Jellyfin: the link no longer matches. Ask for a new link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas le Jellyfin de %@ : le lien ne correspond plus. Demande-lui un nouveau lien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Jellyfin has no home: its Mira plugin needs updating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Jellyfin n’a pas de foyer : son extension Mira doit être à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link has expired (48 h). Ask %@ for a new home link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien a expiré (48 h). Demande un nouveau lien du foyer à %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link was already used or taken back. Ask %@ for a new home link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien a déjà servi ou a été retiré. Demande un nouveau lien du foyer à %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile’s session has ended. Pick a profile again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La session de ce profil a pris fin. Choisis de nouveau un profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To come back, you’ll need the home’s password and a new link from %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour revenir, il faudra le mot de passe du foyer et un nouveau lien de %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To come back, you’ll need the home’s password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour revenir, il faudra le mot de passe du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many tries: try again in %lld min.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trop d’essais : réessaie dans %lld min."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off the home?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver le foyer ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off the home…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver le foyer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer le foyer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the home’s password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape le mot de passe du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "up to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "jusqu’à %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use my own account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser mon propre compte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who’s watching?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui regarde ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a PIN": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec un code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your family types it once per device, then picks their profile. Changing it signs every device out of the home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta famille le tape une fois par appareil, puis choisit son profil. Le changer fait sortir tous les appareils du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Who’s watching?” opens again; this iPhone stays in the home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Qui regarde ? » revient ; cet iPhone reste dans le foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key that can do three things only: make the home links, remove a device, and keep your rules right. Tick exactly what the picture shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une clé qui ne sait faire que trois choses : les liens du foyer, retirer un appareil, et garder tes règles justes. Coche exactement ce que montre le dessin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule lets home devices go further than Jellyfin in a way Mira won’t change without you. Open your rules in Tailscale, or ask for help on Mira’s Discord.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une règle laisse les appareils du foyer aller plus loin que Jellyfin d’une façon que Mira ne change pas sans toi. Ouvre tes règles dans Tailscale, ou demande de l’aide sur le Discord de Mira."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the %@ tag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter l’étiquette %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Away from home · Step %lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loin de la maison · Étape %1$lld sur %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking with Tailscale…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification avec Tailscale…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Client secret · shown once": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client secret · montré une fois"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Client secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secret du client"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copié."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the secret, Mira does the rest": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copie le secret, Mira fait le reste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copier « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drawing of Tailscale’s page": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dessin de la page de Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found a Tailscale secret you just copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un secret Tailscale que tu viens de copier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give Mira a key to your network": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Donne à Mira une clé de ton réseau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the lines": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cacher les lignes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home devices reach only Jellyfin on your Tailscale network. Checked just now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les appareils du foyer n’atteignent que Jellyfin sur ton réseau Tailscale. Vérifié à l’instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I see the secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vois le secret"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can do what the home needs, and no more": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle fait ce qu’il faut au foyer, et rien de plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was deleted or revoked in Tailscale. Home links can’t be made until you give Mira a new one. Devices already in the home keep working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle a été supprimée ou révoquée dans Tailscale. Plus de nouveaux liens du foyer tant que tu n’en donnes pas une autre à Mira. Les appareils déjà dans le foyer continuent de marcher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was made with “All - Read & Write”: it could change anything on your network, and it would sit on your server. Mira won’t use it. Delete it in Tailscale and make one with Custom scopes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle a été faite avec « All - Read & Write » : elle pourrait tout changer sur ton réseau, et elle serait gardée sur ton serveur. Mira ne s’en sert pas. Supprime-la dans Tailscale et fais-en une avec Custom scopes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I’ve saved the tag": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J’ai enregistré l’étiquette"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jellyfin’s PC couldn’t reach Tailscale. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le PC de Jellyfin n’a pas pu joindre Tailscale. Réessaie dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave as it is": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisse tel quel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the family watch away from home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser la famille regarder loin de la maison"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a label for the family’s devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crée une étiquette pour les appareils de la famille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faire les changements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make these %lld changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faire ces %lld changements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make this change": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faire ce changement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira can fix that in %lld change(s), keeping your comments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira peut corriger cela en %lld changement(s), sans toucher à tes commentaires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira can’t do this step for you: Tailscale asks for it first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira ne peut pas faire cette étape à ta place : Tailscale la demande d’abord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira changed your rules. You can undo it until %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira a changé tes règles. Tu peux annuler jusqu’à %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira checked your key and your rules with Tailscale: home devices reach only Jellyfin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira a vérifié ta clé et tes règles avec Tailscale : les appareils du foyer n’atteignent que Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira checked your key with Tailscale. Your rules would let a home device see your whole network, so Mira will make %lld change(s). Your comments stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira a vérifié ta clé avec Tailscale. Tes règles laisseraient un appareil du foyer voir tout ton réseau : Mira va y faire %lld changement(s). Tes commentaires restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name it %@ (Copy button below).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nomme-la %@ (bouton Copier ci-dessous)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas réglé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is written until you tap. You can undo it for 10 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien n’est écrit avant que tu touches. Tu peux annuler pendant 10 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One box, not two: the client ID is inside the secret.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une seule case, pas deux : l’identifiant du client est dans le secret."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One thing left: your network’s rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une dernière chose : les règles de ton réseau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the secret is needed: the client ID is already inside it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seul le secret compte : l’identifiant est dedans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open my rules in Tailscale": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir mes règles dans Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redo step 2": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refaire l’étape 2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rule %lld let everyone go everywhere: it now covers your own devices and the friends you share with, not the home’s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La règle %lld laissait tout le monde aller partout : elle couvre maintenant tes propres appareils et les amis avec qui tu partages, pas ceux du foyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rules Mira can’t fix by itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des règles que Mira ne sait pas corriger seule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rules: %lld change(s) to make": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Règles : %lld changement(s) à faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See the exact lines": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voir les lignes exactes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send it to someone in the family: it opens Mira on your home, wherever they are. Works once, ends after 48 hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envoie-le à quelqu’un de la famille : il ouvre Mira sur ton foyer, où qu’il soit. Il sert une fois et finit au bout de 48 heures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Régler de nouveau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Régler…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone changed them while Mira was reading them. Check again, then fix them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu’un les a modifiées pendant que Mira les lisait. Vérifie de nouveau, puis corrige."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale accepts the key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale accepte la clé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale calls it a tag. It’s how your network tells the home’s devices apart, so they can reach Jellyfin and nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale l’appelle « tag ». C’est ainsi que ton réseau reconnaît les appareils du foyer : ils atteignent Jellyfin, et rien d’autre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale didn’t take the ID read from the secret: paste the Client ID shown just above the secret too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale n’a pas reconnu l’identifiant tiré du secret : colle aussi le Client ID affiché juste au-dessus du secret."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale is off on Jellyfin’s PC": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale est éteint sur le PC de Jellyfin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale isn’t answering": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale ne répond pas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale no longer knows this key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale ne reconnaît plus cette clé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale shows it once. Mira sends it to your Jellyfin, which keeps it; this iPhone never stores it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale ne le montre qu’une fois. Mira l’envoie à ton Jellyfin, qui le garde ; cet iPhone ne le garde jamais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Credential, choose OAuth, then Custom scopes. Not “All”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche Credential, choisis OAuth, puis Custom scopes. Pas « All »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Generate credential.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche Generate credential."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Save tag, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche Save tag, puis reviens ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Tags, then Create tag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche Tags, puis Create tag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ tag is missing: Mira adds it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’étiquette %@ manque : Mira l’ajoute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ tag is there": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’étiquette %@ est là"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The family can watch away from home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La famille peut regarder loin de la maison"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tag isn’t in the list? Step 1 wasn’t saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’étiquette n’est pas dans la liste ? L’étape 1 n’a pas été enregistrée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key can do too much": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette clé peut trop de choses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is missing one tick: Policy File": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il manque une coche à cette clé : Policy File"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is missing one tick: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il manque une coche à cette clé : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is missing some ticks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il manque des coches à cette clé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is missing some ticks: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il manque des coches à cette clé : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tick Read and Write on Policy File, Devices › Core and Keys › Auth Keys. On the last two, pick the tag %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coche Read et Write sur Policy File, Devices › Core et Keys › Auth Keys. Sur les deux derniers, choisis l’étiquette %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today the home works on your Wi-Fi only. Mira walks you through Tailscale once, about 3 minutes. After that, a home link is all the family needs: no address, no Tailscale account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd’hui le foyer ne marche que sur ton Wi-Fi. Mira te guide une fois dans Tailscale, environ 3 minutes. Ensuite, un lien du foyer suffit à la famille : ni adresse, ni compte Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn it on on Jellyfin’s PC, then check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allume-le sur le PC de Jellyfin, puis vérifie de nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it Mira can’t do its job. Tailscale can’t change a key once made: make a new one, with the three lines ticked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans elle, Mira ne peut pas faire son travail. Tailscale ne modifie pas une clé déjà faite : fais-en une nouvelle, avec les trois lignes cochées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it Mira can’t fix your rules. Tailscale can’t change a key once made: make a new one, with the three lines ticked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans elle, Mira ne peut pas corriger tes règles. Tailscale ne modifie pas une clé déjà faite : fais-en une nouvelle, avec les trois lignes cochées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your previous rules are back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les règles d’avant sont revenues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules are right": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes règles sont justes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules just changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes règles viennent de changer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules let home devices see your whole network": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes règles laissent les appareils du foyer voir tout ton réseau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not this one": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pas celle-ci"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re invited to watch": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu es invité à regarder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A private line to your friend’s PC, made for you. Nothing to install or sign up for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une ligne privée vers le PC de ton ami, faite pour toi. Rien à installer ni à créer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend sees this device’s name, its system, its public IP address and when it last connected, and what you watch on their server, like on any shared server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton ami voit le nom de cet appareil, son système, son adresse IP publique et sa dernière connexion, et ce que tu regardes sur son serveur, comme sur tout serveur partagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start watching": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commencer à regarder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reaching your friend’s server…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connexion au serveur de ton ami…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost there": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presque prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend needs to let this device in: they see it in Mira. Keep Mira open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton ami doit laisser entrer cet appareil : il le voit dans Mira. Garde Mira ouverte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite was already used": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette invitation a déjà servi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An invite works once. Ask your friend for a new one: it takes them one click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une invitation ne sert qu’une fois. Demandes-en une nouvelle à ton ami : un clic lui suffit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite has ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette invitation a expiré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An invite lasts 48 hours. Ask your friend for a new one: it takes them one click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une invitation dure 48 heures. Demandes-en une nouvelle à ton ami : un clic lui suffit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend didn’t let this device in. Ask them for a new invite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton ami n’a pas laissé entrer cet appareil. Demande-lui une nouvelle invitation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have an address instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J’ai une adresse à la place"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server doesn’t have the up-to-date Mira extension yet: ask your friend to update Mira.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce serveur n’a pas encore l’extension Mira à jour : demande à ton ami de mettre Mira à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is already in a home joined by a link. Leave that home first, then open the invite again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil est déjà dans un foyer rejoint par un lien. Quitte ce foyer d’abord, puis rouvre l’invitation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend took this device off their server. Ask them for a new invite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton ami a retiré cet appareil de son serveur. Demande-lui une nouvelle invitation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend’s server didn’t answer. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur de ton ami n’a pas répondu. Réessaie dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend’s server isn’t answering right now. Mira keeps trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur de ton ami ne répond pas pour l’instant. Mira réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The home away from home, a friend’s server": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le foyer loin de la maison, le serveur d’un ami"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale’s coordination server and its relays, your router (as Built-in Tailscale), then the home’s or the friend’s Jellyfin alone, on its administrator’s Tailscale network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur de coordination de Tailscale et ses relais, ton routeur (comme Tailscale intégré), puis le seul Jellyfin du foyer ou de l’ami, sur le réseau Tailscale de son administrateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only after a home link or a friend’s invite opened in Mira, each time Mira opens, until you leave the home or your friend removes this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seulement après un lien du foyer ou l’invitation d’un ami ouverts dans Mira, à chaque ouverture de Mira, jusqu’à ce que tu quittes le foyer ou que ton ami retire cet iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As Built-in Tailscale, without your Tailscale account: the device’s name, its system, its IP addresses and its public key; the link’s single-use key, once. The host so sees this iPhone’s name, its system, its public IP address and when it last connected. Videos stay end-to-end encrypted, no log is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme Tailscale intégré, sans ton compte Tailscale : le nom de l’appareil, son système, ses adresses IP et sa clé publique ; la clé à usage unique du lien, une fois. L’hôte voit donc le nom de cet iPhone, son système, son adresse IP publique et sa dernière connexion. Les vidéos restent chiffrées de bout en bout, aucun journal n’est envoyé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Leave this home”, in Settings → Switch profile. At a friend’s: they remove this iPhone, or another invite takes it elsewhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Quitter ce foyer », dans Réglages → Changer de profil. Chez un ami : il retire cet iPhone, ou une autre invitation l’emmène ailleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
